          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Hospital bassinet features</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">A</span></span>. Soft-edge basket</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Soft-edge basket with tilting feature helps to improve visibility and interaction for mothers to their newborns.</span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">B</span></span>. Three points of contact</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The basket, secured by three points of contact, helps to provide mothers and caregivers peace of mind.</span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">C</span></span>. Steer-locking, soft-wheel casters</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Steer-locking, soft-wheel casters give newborns a smooth, quiet ride, while providing stability and maneuverability during transportation.</span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">D</span></span>. Open-style chart holder</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Open-style chart holder allows caregivers easy access to patient information.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 15 2024 16:48:48 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0)",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
