          "jcr:created": "Mon Sep 16 2024 15:40:18 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">97%</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">of the 120 nurses surveyed agree that Nära allows them to provide better overall care for their patients.<sup>1</sup></span></p>\n",
